          "rating": 5,
          "relativeTimeDescription": "3 years ago",
          "text": "I went into Icebox to buy some diamond earrings and was helped by Aumsri. She was super friendly and professional. She took the time to listen to what I was looking for and understand what my taste is in jewelry. Her depth in knowing about diamonds and pieces was very impressive. She was helpful in showing me pieces that would be of my interest and she was patient with me in making my decision. I really had a good experience at Icebox with her good customer service and professionalism. I didn't feel like she was just trying to get me to make a purchase like many jeweler employees do.Thanks ivevar",
          "time": 1681803393,
